---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/index.css";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="me">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/400" alt="Portrait of Hanzla" />
      </div>

      <div class="about">
        <p>Hi, I'm a developer and AI student based in Pakistan.</p>

        <p>
          I've spent the last couple of years building things for the web, from
          full-stack applications and APIs to smaller tools and experiments. I
          enjoy working across the stack, with a particular interest in backend
          development and the systems that make products work behind the scenes.
        </p>

        <p>
          I've worked as a MERN Developer Intern at&nbsp;
          <a
            href="https://10pearls.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            10Pearls
          </a>
          , and an AI/ML Intern at&nbsp;
          <a
            href="https://caipsd.iub.edu.pk/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            CAIPSD, IUB
          </a>
          , where I got to work on real projects and learn alongside other developers.
          I'm currently pursuing a Backend AI Engineering internship at&nbsp;
          <a
            href="https://flyrank.ai/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            FlyRank
          </a>
          , exploring the intersection of backend systems and AI.
        </p>

        <p>
          I'm currently studying Artificial Intelligence at&nbsp;
          <a
            href="https://iub.edu.pk/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            The Islamia University of Bahawalpur
          </a>. I'm interested in learning through practical work, building
          projects, and exploring new areas of software development alongside my
          studies.
        </p>

        <p>
          When I'm not coding, you can usually find me playing games, exploring
          new technology, working on a side project, or going down a rabbit hole
          about something I've just discovered.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
